WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:12.000
Start with the part you can observe.

00:12.000 --> 00:24.000
Follow the relationship as it changes.

00:24.000 --> 00:36.000
A datum gives multiple measurements a shared reference. A section view reveals internal relationships along a chosen plane.

00:36.000 --> 00:48.000
Measure a component’s height from the same baseline on both drawings; the comparison is meaningful only if the datum matches.

00:48.000 --> 01:00.000
Drawing markup

01:00.000 --> 01:12.000
A view can support interpretation; it cannot prove hidden structure or compliance by itself.

